WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.659
Hi I'm Yelena, I'm a makeup artist
and if you want to get this winged

00:00:03.659 --> 00:00:11.490
eyeliner look then keep on watching. For
eyeliner I like to use a felt tip

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:16.379
because it has a thin applicator which
gives you a sharp line. First I draw a

00:00:16.379 --> 00:00:21.900
line from the outer corner of my eye up
towards where my eyebrow ends. I line my

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:26.519
eyes using light strokes to gradually
build up the winged shape. I then connect

00:00:26.519 --> 00:00:31.320
the tip to the middle of my eye. I like
to start off thin so I can easily build

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:35.610
up the thickness. Don't worry if you make
a mistake, you can always go in with a

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:46.649
concealer and brush to clean up for a
defined finish. For more videos like this

00:00:46.649 --> 00:00:50.960
subscribe to GLAMOUR UK's YouTube
channel.

